dsl metta

Concept Field extends TypedNode as component
	def string doc
	def string[] aliases
	def word:{Ascending Descending Ignore} order = Ascending
	
	facet Presence
		sub Required
		sub Nullable

	has:{0..1} Default

Concept Default as component
	facet Value
		sub NullValue
		sub BooleanValue > def boolean value
		sub IntValue > def integer value
		sub LongValue > def long value
		sub FloatValue > def double value
		sub DoubleValue > def double value
		sub StringValue > def string value
		sub EnumValue > def string symbol
		sub EmptyArray
		sub EmptyMap

Concept Items extends TypedNode as component
Concept Values extends TypedNode as component
Concept Option extends TypedNode as component

Concept TypedNode as component
	facet Type
		sub Null
		sub Boolean
		sub Int
		sub Long
		sub Float
		sub Double
		sub Bytes
		sub String
		
		sub RecordRef
			def Record target
			
		sub EnumRef
			def Enum target
			
		sub FixedRef
			def Fixed target
		
		sub Array
			has:{1..1} Items
			
		sub Map
			has:{1..1} Values
			
		sub Union
			has:{2..*} Option
			
		sub Decimal
			def word:{Bytes Fixed} storage = Bytes
			def integer precision
			def integer scale = 0
			def integer fixedSize
			def string fixedName
			
		sub BigDecimal
		sub Uuid
			def word:{String Fixed} storage = String
			def string fixedName = "UuidFixed"
			
		sub Date
		sub TimeMillis
		sub TimeMicros
		sub TimestampMillis
		sub TimestampMicros
		sub TimestampNanos
		sub LocalTimestampMillis
		sub LocalTimestampMicros
		sub LocalTimestampNanos
		sub Duration